  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Institutional Strategic Plan of CEJIL Mesoamerica 2019-22</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional support to the strategic plan of CEJIL on defence and promotion of human rights through the effective use of the Inter American System for Protection of Human Rights. CEJIL works on the following four lines of action: 1) legal defence; 2) empowering human rights defenders and other key actors; 3) strengthening of the Inter-American System; 4) distribution of knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
